{"id": 992084, "slug": "airborne-justice", "name": "Airborne Justice", "name_original": "Airborne Justice", "description": ".<br/><br/>Airborne Justice offers an old-school arcade experience for one or two players. As the Thunderflash team, Rock and Stan (protagonists previously seen in Thunderflash and Biomech Hell), you'll pilot a helicopter capable of rapid fire, maneuver through the clouds, and harness the incredible power of thunder. <br/>Five levels filled with challenges create a short but satisfying game, with the option to replay with extra modes!<br/><br/><strong>Features:</strong><br/><br/><ul><li>A tribute to the 194X series and many other genre classics!<br/></li><li>Play with a friend and enjoy double the fun!<br/></li><li>Pixel art graphics!<br/></li><li>Top-notch soundtrack!<br/></li><li>Unlock incredible pixel art artwork!<br/></li><li>Various power-ups and the ability to activate the \"Thunderflash\" bomb!<br/></li><li>Secret extra modes: Speed Mode, Remix Mode, and Survival Mode!<br/></li><li>Take down huge bosses by hitting their weak points!<br/></li><li>Plenty of achievements!</li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2024-11-04", "tba": false, "updated": "2024-11-08T08:29:16", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/c0b/c0b9ff921727a90ebcdc4cedd5249f64.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/db1/db1cb453a326c1e9c871d475a564af66.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 7, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestions_count": 178, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", "parents_count": 0,